      "end": 7.15,
      "wordCount": 6,
      "rate": "+6%",
      "pitch": "-7Hz",
      "volume": "+15%"
    },
    {
      "text": "La pista está en su etiqueta.",
      "start": 8.15,
      "end": 10.526,
      "wordCount": 6,
      "rate": "+7%",
      "pitch": "-3Hz",
      "volume": "+16%"
    },
    {
      "text": "Leé los ingredientes. Tenés seis segundos para memorizarlos.",
      "start": 11.05,
      "end": 15.97,
      "wordCount": 8,
      "rate": "+8%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "volume": "+17%"
    },
    {
      "text": "¡Tiempo! ¿Cuántos recordás?",
